NC Digital creates professional logos and brand identities for businesses in Aberdare and across the South Wales Valleys. Every logo is designed by hand — no AI, no templates — giving your business a unique identity built to last.

## A strong brand for Aberdare businesses

Whether you're a tradesperson, a local retailer, or a professional services business, a well-designed logo signals credibility before you've had the chance to say a word. It works across your website, your van, your social media, and any printed materials — giving your business a consistent presence everywhere your customers find you.

## What's included

- 5 initial logo concepts
- Revisions until you're completely happy
- Brand colour palette and typography
- Brand guidelines document
- All file formats: PNG, SVG, PDF, JPEG

Full details on our [logo design service](/services/logo-design/).

## No AI. Designed by hand.

Every logo is created in Adobe Illustrator — not generated by AI tools. Your logo is unique to your business.

## Pair it with a website

We build websites alongside new identities so your brand is consistent from day one. See our [web design service](/services/web-design/) or [view our portfolio](/portfolio/).

